WEBVTT

00:13:59.875 --> 00:14:04.309
It gives us a quiet universe
that we can share together,

00:14:04.333 --> 00:14:06.583
that we can share in equally.

00:14:08.500 --> 00:14:11.601
You're probably wondering now
what happened to Patrick.

00:14:11.625 --> 00:14:13.333
Did reading save his life?

00:14:14.583 --> 00:14:16.708
It did and it didn't.

00:14:17.875 --> 00:14:20.768
When Patrick got out of prison,

00:14:20.792 --> 00:14:23.125
his journey was excruciating.

00:14:24.292 --> 00:14:27.768
Employers turned him away
because of his record,

00:14:27.792 --> 00:14:30.934
his best friend, his mother,
died at age 43